research/audit/wave12-real-analysis.proof-contracts.json-5883-          "quote": "Let $F$ be an ordered field. For $a, b \\ge 0$: $$a < b \\iff a^2 < b^2, \\qquad a \\le b \\iff a^2 \\le b^2.$$ More generally, for arbitrary $a, b \\in F$, $a^2 < b^2 \\iff |a| < |b|$.",
